{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026kfKCWOcphU1788159159.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃色暴雨警告現正生效。天文台稱，沙德爾的殘餘今日黃昏前後移向海南島東南沿岸一帶，並逐漸增強為熱帶低氣壓，會視乎其發展及與本港的距離，屆時考慮發出一號戒備信號。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1100.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026hxSx7AxyN91788147677.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-1100.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台預料，該低壓系統明日至周三，橫過南海北部，並逐漸靠近廣東東部沿岸。受其與東北季候風的共同影響，本港明日日間至周三風勢較大，天文台會密切監測其動向及本港風力變化，評估是否需要發出更高熱帶氣旋警告信號。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026qx32v5hvdR1788147673.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-1100_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">預測今日部分地區驟雨較多及有狂風雷暴。展望明日部分地區驟雨較多，稍後至周三風勢較大，本周後期驟雨減少。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T06:59:27.646346+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}